5752	### Trait / enum / use classification
5753	
5754	`split_trait_methods` distinguishes required (no `body()`) from provided methods. `fn_to_method` formats the method signature as `"(params) -> ReturnType"`, captures `async`, and maps visibility via `node_visibility`.
