      "name": "LangData::ts",
      "signature": "pub fn ts(&self) -> Option<&TsData>",
      "description": "01-core-architecture.md:419-421. Returns Some(&TsData) only when self is the Ts variant; None for every other variant (Rust, Python, Go, Java).",
